  "id": "right-wing-authoritarianism",
  "term": "right-wing authoritarianism",
  "definition": "Right-wing authoritarianism is an individual difference that, in this research, helps explain how people react to anti-prejudice messages. Higher levels were linked with consistently greater prejudice and little change across messages, suggesting resistance to prejudice-reduction appeals.",
